' S-544: a bare call that means a METHOD of the class (written later in the class) is not a use of the SUB of the same name that comes after the class.
CLASS Sayac
    PUBLIC
    DIM n AS I32
    METHOD Artir()
        n = n + 1
        Yaz()
    END METHOD
    METHOD Yaz()
        PRINT n
    END METHOD
END CLASS
SUB Yaz()
    PRINT 99
END SUB
DIM s AS Sayac = NEW Sayac()
s.Artir()
Yaz()
